pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 52, 500, 14]
    content:
      style: "$kick"
      wrap: false
      text: 04 / 界面实拍 INTERFACE
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 88, 700, 36]
    content:
      style: "$h2"
      wrap: false
      text: 审看工作台：每个镜头都有来处和去处。
  - elementId: shot
    elementType: image
    bounds: [56, 148, 560, 324]
    src: media/ui-workbench.png
    fit: {mode: contain}
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: a1-tick
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [648, 152, 14, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$gold"}
  - elementId: a1-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [648, 164, 256, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 镜头切分
  - elementId: a1-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [648, 186, 256, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      color: "$sub"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: 25 个镜头连续覆盖全片，按原片时间 [start, end) 定位，点击即播对应片段。
  - elementId: a2-tick
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [648, 258, 14, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$gold"}
  - elementId: a2-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [648, 270, 256, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 章节定位
  - elementId: a2-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [648, 292, 256, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      color: "$sub"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: 全片自动归为 6 个章节，长片也能先找段落、再看镜头。
  - elementId: a3-tick
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [648, 364, 14, 3]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$gold"}
  - elementId: a3-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [648, 376, 256, 20]
    content:
      fontSize: 14
      color: "$ink"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      bold: true
      wrap: false
      text: 审看重点
  - elementId: a3-body
    elementType: text
    bounds: [648, 398, 256, 60]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      color: "$sub"
      fontFamily: {latin: Liter, ea: MiSans}
      lineHeight: 1.6
      text: 创作者写下想表达的重点，模型与画面一起读，不自行脑补意图。
  - elementId: shot-cap
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 480, 560, 14]
    content:
      style: "$cap"
      wrap: false
      text: 实拍界面 · 「杭州一日游」审看工作台
  - elementId: foot-line
    elementType: line
    bounds: [56, 500, 848, 1]
    viewBox: [848, 1]
    points: "0,0.5 848,0.5"
    curve: sharp
    border: {style: solid, width: 1, color: "$line"}
  - elementId: foot-l
    elementType: text
    bounds: [56, 508, 400, 12]
    content:
      style: "$foot"
      wrap: false
      text: 叙光集 LUMENARRATIVE
  - elementId: foot-r
    elementType: text
    bounds: [504, 508, 400, 12]
    content:
      style: "$foot"
      align: [right, top]
      wrap: false
      text: 05 / 12
